    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The registration certificate (RC) is a crucial document as it proves the ownership of the vehicle. A self-attested photocopy ensures its authenticity and helps prevent any fraudulent activities.</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate verifies that the vehicle meets the emission standards set by the government. A valid PUC ensures the vehicle is in good condition and safe for transportation.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid insurance certificate covers any potential damages or accidents during transportation. This crucial document provides peace of mind for both the transport company and the vehicle owner.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-approved Consignment Bill of Lading:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">An International Bill of Lading (IBA-approved) is a legally binding document that outlines the details of the vehicle and its journey. It ensures accountability and transparency between the vehicle owner and the transport company.</p>
  </div>
</div>
	<h3>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
	<p>In addition to the mentioned paperwork, an essential aspect of safe vehicle transport services is a comprehensive insurance policy.</p>
	<p>Many transport companies offer a 100% declared-value marine transit insurance policy to provide top-notch protection for your vehicle during transportation. This insurance covers any damages, theft, or accidents that may happen during the journey.</p>
	<p>By opting for a company offering this insurance, you can have peace of mind knowing that your vehicle is fully protected throughout the transportation process.</p>
	<h4>Benefits of Iso Certified Vehicle Transport Services</h4>
	<p>Iso certified vehicle transport services provide numerous benefits that ensure secure and safe transportation:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Professional and Experienced Team:</strong> Iso certified transport companies have a team of experienced professionals who understand the importance of safe transportation. They employ measures to ensure the vehicle remains in pristine condition throughout the journey.</li>
		<li><strong>Comprehensive Insurance:</strong> The 100% declared-value marine transit insurance provides a strong layer of protection for your vehicle, covering any potential damages or accidents.</li>
		<li><strong>Certified Vehicle Transport:</strong> Iso certified transport companies prioritize quality control measures, ensuring that your vehicle is transported in accordance with industry standards.</li>
		<li><strong>Transportation Protocols:</strong> Iso certified transport companies adhere to strict transportation protocols, which include proper vehicle handling, loading, and unloading procedures.</li>
		<li><strong>Transportation Tracking:</strong> Many Iso certified transport companies provide tracking services, allowing you to monitor the status and location of your vehicle during transportation.</li>
	</ul>
